The following is a list of the files included with this demo of ObjectPM

You must copy these DLL's to somewhere in your LIBPATH (c:\os2\dll is OK)
bsebc20a.dll			Baseset DLL
opmbc20a.dll			Windowing DLL

opminfo					Overview of ObjectPM, including a class tree


Demonstration of controls (including our custom cellbox control)
----------------------------------------------------------------
controls\
	about.dlg			.dlg for the about box
	about.h				defines for the about box
	controls.cpp		program source
	controls.def		.def file for command line compiling
	controls.exe		the demo program
	controls.h			defines for the demo program
	controls.hpp		header for the demo program
	controls.prj		.prj file for compiling from the IDE
	controls.rc			resource fiel for the demo program
	makefile			makefile for command line compiling
	mark.ico			button icon
	objpm.ico			program icon
	paint.ico			button icon
	trash.ico			button icon

Demonstration of the ObjectPM Forms System, which turns ordinary
dialog boxes into full functions entry forms
----------------------------------------------------------------
formdemo\
	formdemo.cpp		program source
	formdemo.def		.def file for command line compiling
	formdemo.exe		the demo program
	formdemo.h			defines for the demo program
	formdemo.hlp		on-line help for the demo program
	formdemo.hpp		header for the demo program
	formdemo.ipf		source for the on-line help
	formdemo.prj		.prj file for compiling from the IDE
	formdemo.ptr		demo program pointer
	formdemo.rc			resource file for the demo program

