	hello.hpp			header for the demo program
	hello.prj			.prj file for compiling from the IDE
	hello.rc			resource file for the demo program
	makefile			makefile for command line compiling
	objpm.ico			program icon
						
An MDI (Multiple Document Interface) file editor demonstrating the MDI
classes and other more advanced library features
----------------------------------------------------------------------
mdiedit\
	document.ico		document icon
	makefile			makefile for command line compiling
	mdidlg.dlg			.dlg file for the program
	mdidlg.h			defines for the resources
	mdiedit.cpp			program source
	mdiedit.def			.def file for command line compiling
	mdiedit.exe			the program
	mdiedit.hpp			header for the program
	mdiedit.prj			.prj for compiling from the IDE
	mdiedit.rc			resource file for the program
						
